  <participating-org role="4" type="24">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Migori County Youth Forum (MCYF) is an umbrella body of1325 village youth Bunges (Youth Groups) with membership of about 27,000 across Migori County; the organization is registered by the Ministry of Social, Gender and Sports. The organization has strategic objectives of reducing vulnerability and increase in the income base of Youth, women and persons living with disability, supporting the establishment of consolidation of a culture of peace,leadership and good governance within Migori County.
The youth groups drawn fromall over Migori County came together to form a formidable force to demand the rights ofthe youths through meaningful engagement with the County and national government officers, institutions, and departments.</narrative>
